      "writtenOn": "2022-12-16T00:52:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "UNKNOWN when battery health is not supported from the device.\n\nNOT_AVAILABLE when there is not enough information to determine an accurate value, The value might become UNSPECIFIED_FAILURE, DEAD or any other state except for UNKNOWN later.\n\nINVALID is used when the internal data is inconsistent and the battery needs to go through (or is going through) a recalibration process. The value might become NOT_AVAILABLE, UNSPECIFIED_FAILURE, DEAD or any other state except for UNKNOWN.",
      "parentUuid": "4d48f5e9_05a3af29",
